{"id": "wwdc2019-257", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/257", "wordCount": 1206, "segments": [{"start": 15.0, "text": "Good morning everyone."}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "My name is Gary and I am an"}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "engineer on the Accessibility"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "Team."}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "Today, I'm excited to talk about"}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "a tool called Accessibility"}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "Inspector."}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "The Accessibility Inspector"}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "provides an easy way to find,"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "diagnose, and fix accessibility"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "issues within your app."}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "In this presentation, we will be"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "doing exactly that, using a"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "sample app."}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "Let's jump right into it."}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "So here this is my Peanut Butter"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "Tracking App."}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "It helps my fellow peanut butter"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "lovers."}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "Tracks their favor brand, rate,"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "them and record details about"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "them."}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "Tapping on the particular cell"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "will bring me to the Detail View"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "for that particular brand."}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "And in here, I can take photos"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "of my favorite peanut butter."}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "I could favorite it or I could"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "buy it again and share with my"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "friends."}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "Now I want to test for"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "accessibility issues from my"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "Detailed View but I'm not quite"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "sure where to start."}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "The Accessibility Inspector"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "makes this daunting task easy."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "Let's start by opening the"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "Accessibility Inspector."}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "So first, I'll go over to Xcode"}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "and under the Xcode Menu you'll"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "see Open Developer Tools."}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "And in here, you can find the"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "Accessibility Inspector."}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "You might notice what seems to"}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "be a large tooltip."}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "This is actually a new feature"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "that we added for low vision"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "user on the Mac."}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "It is called Hover Text and it"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "makes anything under the mouse"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "cursor larger and sharper to"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "see."}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "And we'll be using it throughout our demo today."}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "So now with Inspector open, I'm"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "going to use the Target"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "Selection Drop Down to select my"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "iOS device."}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "The Inspector has three main"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "parts."}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "First, the Inspector tab."}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "Then the Audit tab."}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "And the Settings tab."}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "Let's focus on the Audit tab for"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "now."}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "This is one of the easiest ways"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "to help me find accessibility"}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "issues in my app."}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "By pressing on the Run Audit"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "button, you'll get a list of"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "potential accessibility issues."}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "So let's try that for our view."}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "Immediately, you see that it"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "found a bunch of issues."}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "And clicking on the issue will"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "highlight the problematic"}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "element in yellow."}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "Let's start in the middle with"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "Image name used in description."}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "This issue seems to affect all"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "three of our custom buttons."}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "Assistive technologies like"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "VoiceOver uses accessibility"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "information such as a Label to"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "help users interact and navigate"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "with the UI in your view."}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "But how exactly do we provide"}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "such information to the"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "assisting technologies?"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "You can click on the Help button"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "on the right to get a suggestion"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "for what to do."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "So here it states that consider"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "setting a human readable,"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "localized accessibilityLabel."}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "Now let's head back to our"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "Inspector tab."}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "Now I want to inspect for my"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "custom buttons."}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "And to do that, you'll press the"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "Point Inspection button on the"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "top."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "Now with my fingers down on the"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "screen, I can move around and"}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "focus on any accessible element."}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "Let's start with the Custom"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "button."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "Here under the Basic section,"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "you'll see the Label property is"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "set to the Image File Name."}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "This creates a poor experience"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "for our users."}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "And to help you get an idea of"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "this experience, we added a new"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "feature that will simulate a"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "VoiceOver would say by"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "pressing on the speaker button."}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "Camera.on.rectangle button."}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "And I can use the Next button"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "to jump to the next element."}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "Sue.heart button."}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "Cart.badge.plus button."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "So as we navigated over the"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "buttons, we heard unhelpful"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "descriptions."}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "These descriptions didn't really"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "tell us what the buttons do."}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "So let's jump into Code and add"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "some meaningful Labels for"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "Custom buttons."}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "To add a Label, we'll simply set"}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "the accessibility Label"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "attribute under View."}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "So for my Favorite button, I'll"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "set it equal to the state of"}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "favorite."}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "And for my Camera button, I'll"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "simply set it to take a photo."}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "And for my Buy button, I'll set"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "it as Buy."}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "And remember to properly"}, {"start": 315.0, "text": "localize your string."}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "So now let's head back to the"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "Inspector to see our remaining"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "issues."}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "Here it looks like there's a"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "potentially inaccessible text."}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "If you're using sender UIKit or"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "app key controls, then"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "accessibility comes for free."}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "However, in this case, we're"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "drawing the brand name using"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "CATextLayer, which means we're"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "responsible for handling our own"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "accessibility."}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "Let's jump into Code to see how"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "we can make this Custom text"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "accessible."}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "So the first thing that I'll"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "have to do is to let the"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "assistive technologies know that"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "this is an accessibility element"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "and to do that, I'll simply set"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "the isAccessibilityElement to"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "true."}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "Next, I'll have to give it a"}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "meaningful Label."}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "And in our case, we'll set it"}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "equal to the brandName and"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "that's it."}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "So let's jump back to the"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "Inspector to see our final"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "issue."}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "Here it looks like there's a"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "contrast problem for our"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "brandName."}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "We can click on the Disclosure"}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "triangle to get a more detailed"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "explanation."}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "Here it shows a contrast ratio"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "and the color we used to"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "calculate it."}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "Displaying information in a"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "clear and legible manner is"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "crucial."}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "But it looks like the contrast"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "for our brand name is too poor"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "for the users to pick out text."}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "Let's click on the Help button."}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "Here it says that the"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "recommended contrast ratio"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "should be above 3.0."}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "But how do we achieve this"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "ratio?"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "The Accessibility Inspector has"}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "a helpful tool called the Color"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "Contrast Calculator."}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "This tool insures that the text"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "and it's background meets the"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "recommended contrast ratio."}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "And we can find that tool by"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "going to Menus, Windows, Show"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "Color Contrast Calculator."}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "And now I'll click on the Color"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "Picker to select the light gray"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "color that I used for the brand"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "name."}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "Here you see that the contrast"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "ratio is 2.3 which is below the"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "recommended 3.0 ratio."}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "So now I'm going to use a slider"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "to pick a color to satisfy the"}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "contrast ratio without"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "compromising my original design."}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "And this dark gray color looks"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "just about right."}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "Let's use that in our color."}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "So the first thing now I have to"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "do is to add the darkGrayColor,"}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "then I'll set the"}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "foregroundColor for my textLayer"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "to be the color that we just"}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "added."}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "Now for the moment of truth,"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "let's run the app again to see"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "how it works."}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "While the app is running, I'm"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "going to open the Inspector."}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "To verify that all of our"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "changes works, I'm going to run"}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "the Audit test once more."}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "Great. It looks like all of the"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "warnings are gone."}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "Let's head over to the Inspector"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "tab to see how VoiceOver would"}, {"start": 541.0, "text": "work on this view by pressing on"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "the Auto Navigate button."}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "Nutter Buddy button."}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "Patty's creamy header."}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "Patty's peanut butter jar image."}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "Take a photo button."}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "Favorite button."}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "Buy button."}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "Creamy bullet no-stir."}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "This tastes great."}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "And that's a much better"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "experience."}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "These are just some of the ways"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "of how the Accessibility"}, {"start": 575.0, "text": "Inspector can help you create a"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "fantastic app experience."}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "It is a powerful tool to help"}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "you find and fix accessibility"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "issues and an easy way to get"}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "started with accessibility."}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "I encourage you to spend a few"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "minutes to audit for your own"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "apps and to make sure that your"}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "app is accessible for everyone."}]}